the **Cholesky decomposition** of a complex Hermitian or real symmetric positive-definite matrix
:math:`A \in \mathbb{K}^{n \times n}` is defined as

.. math::

    A = LL^{\text{H}}\mathrlap{\qquad L \in \mathbb{K}^{n \times n}}

